<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 34.29 to 6007.02.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 2.15 to 373.13.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.22.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1292 to 1142.</p>
<p>Volume was 441,080,570, compared with 383,634,340 Monday.</p>
